# AGENTS.md — Four in a Row AI Project (read this first, every session)

## What this project is

A university AI project: a Four in a Row (Connect Four, 7 columns x 6 rows) AI,
built as a small research project and packaged as a usable "strategy coach" app.
The student must present it in **10 minutes** and run a **2–3 minute live demo**.
The professor prefers a **real-life style implementation**, so the app must feel like
a working product: playable, with live stats, hints, and visible AI reasoning.

The student MUST be able to explain every function to the professor. Therefore:
**clarity beats cleverness.** Prefer simple, readable code with comments over tricks.

## Tech stack (do not add dependencies without asking)

Python 3.10+, `pygame`, `numpy` (optional), `matplotlib`, `pandas`, `pytest`.
Everything else must be the Python standard library. Runs on Linux, CPU only, no GPU,
no network access at runtime.

